<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 6: </span>The four types of variation introduced under the <span id="S5.F6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GE</span> setting to evaluate the robustness of AtomVLA. (a) Object position variation. (b) Unseen distractor object. (c) Target height variation. (d) Instruction language variation.</figcaption>
